192a-47fd-bae9-143aa936f0c5" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-06bbb912-e793-4e61-871a-9c7d851a2063" facs="#m-4f578928-3e6c-4105-8fa6-75e63e434d08" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212, or p. 218.</l><l xml:id="m-7efa587d-2cc4-4f41-bfb6-b62d4c1feae1" facs="#m-e01ee16a-b36e-47f6-80ac-62499cdd7db3" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Fámulis tuis. p. 1539.</l><l xml:id="m-8d6d5702-5272-4f6e-a64d-7c497d074e00" facs="#m-643c4c11-5f24-4a80-9997-5faa1a5da306" label="text-like">St. Leo II, Pope and Confessor. Smi-double.</l><l xml:id="m-e7257e03-1c91-4082-8fd1-25509578e692" facs="#m-67f123dd-2e1d-4ef6-8ab8-48107dd153ee" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-85c933e7-e68a-45be-b31d-541fff4dcc86" facs="#m-d8d9d5e2-3cc5-4a8c-90ce-a029037edb42" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-24c8750c-2401-4a81-95e1-1773d232b04c" facs="#m-5b51ca86-19f0-4802-af28-233f09a1d753" label="lyrics-like">Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne, tódi; “ quem totius Ecclésiae praes¬</l><l xml:id="m-411fb33b-e345-49c0-9f27-1a9c2ac94fe1" facs="#m-923dd261-525e-4dd7-9e97-64c8947fd0d6" label="lyrics-like">( placátus inténde: t et per</l><l xml:id="m-ad4a42b7-635f-491d-96ac-6d54a7b581c5" facs="#m-828051c6-ca9d-42ad-9331-f440db2cf8cf" label="lyrics-like">titisti esse pastórem. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-66985f7c-188c-4991-95fe-05f4378832ce" facs="#m-59d2ae41-dde2-4602-8557-e8ab61de3499" label="lyrics-like">beátum Leónem Summum Ponti¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f855c74-38ae-4ef2-8782-e2101a752e8b" facs="#m-ac057ee1-d9a2-4761-96eb-0728fb3a0d3b" label="ambiguous">nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-eef71e73-0c34-4d97-b71e-017116f7386b" facs="#m-99db7afd-f79a-4580-a13e-9d5291533cd9" label="lyrics-like">ficem, perpétua protectióne cus¬</l><l xml:id="m-23f221f8-99b0-45ff-8d5a-9d87cd5d55bb" facs="#m-ec213512-33b1-41c5-bbc0-3f0285eefd4c" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-a44bb21c-445a-4675-ba36-2af656c89202" facs="#m-3c31cc6a-32e7-4fb6-9be0-4c4d5f2a1f51" label="lyrics-like">Blátis munéribus, quaésumus! proficiat ubique succéssus, et grati</l><l xml:id="m-f69e95bc-ac2a-40f0-bb0c-67793b2db2d6" facs="#m-ac7a032d-a0a1-4d91-8fa9-e1cc0824470b" label="lyrics-like">U Dómine, Ecclésiam tuam beni¬</l><l xml:id="m-485b6a9f-70a6-492e-954e-ac8342501b8a" facs="#m-4caec700-9d52-4865-b8bd-e15526ed3768" label="lyrics-like">fiant nómini tuo, te gubernánte,</l><l xml:id="m-e6f4cbb1-cdd8-4476-a29a-1eb35223dc46" facs="#m-d50d614c-d9c3-4346-8fe7-41e09179aa1f" label="lyrics-like">gnus illúmina: ut, et gregis tuil pastóres. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-bdcba3bd-15b9-4e7f-b720-566eb7bcfb0a" facs="#m-31723537-296d-408e-9c1a-c92890d24f0a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-a0ca1d57-fe74-46f9-af56-ed66879521ec" facs="#m-1e3d1e21-d25f-47e5-894d-e45a23c3a4ff" label="lyrics-like">Efectióne sancta enutritam gu-! moderatióne dirécta, et increménta</l><l xml:id="m-1c9c393b-239d-4e4e-a816-720b1ac02370" facs="#m-2005df52-9b05-4c7b-9d99-2440f726341b" label="lyrics-like">L bérna, quaésumus Dómine,llibertátis accipiat et in religiónis</l><l xml:id="m-4f248509-1a87-43b1-b821-a7da87e53dd2" facs="#m-95418b30-78fa-4d9b-9f1d-523d9109afd2" label="lyrics-like">tuam placátus Ecclésiam :ut poténti ] integritáte persístat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-106fdf69-dfc7-4ec7-a6ee-c948cab874f4" facs="#m-b0b9de93-611a-4fec-b9e8-900f6f6d8777" label="text-like">4. Sixth day within the Octave of SS. Peter and Paul.</l><l xml:id="m-545ea072-c969-414b-bae2-b5dc168602af" facs="#m-8db8b78c-8cf9-459c-88b5-d9331e56a679" label="lyrics-like">At Vespers, Commem. Ant. Pétrus Apóstolus. D. 1547. V. Constítues.</l><l xml:id="m-30144adf-9772-4aaa-8958-258e9771aa63" facs="#m-b4ec385f-e973-4b2b-b9b5-9c7866bda29f" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui hodiérnam diem. p. 1519.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
